Restore the original Jester's intended starting equipment.

In v2.0 job-data.h:343, adjacent C++ string literals accidentally combine
"quarterstaff ego:chaos" and "robe" into one invalid item specification.
Restore their missing comma so both original items are given.  At line 344,
use the current parser spelling "atropa" for SPMSL_BLINDING: mapdef.cc's
missile_brands table (4901-4931) and item-prop-enum.h (513-514) define this
mapping, and item-name.cc (402-403) uses the same spelling.  Pies intentionally
retain SPMSL_BLINDING (makeitem.cc:526-527,589-593); quantity remains four.

This repairs actual gameplay, not just the diagnostic: give_job_equipment
(jobs.cc:105-119) uses the same item_list parser as debug_jobdata (145-162).
No tests, parser rules, item brands, or other equipment are changed.

